From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 18:41:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] selftests: apple-dcp: dwc3 mock follows the sleep
 reset-resume field

usb: dwc3: apple: keep a T8132 host's devices through a deep sleep
(e75e0cc4a5, from 6b6d89da7e) adds sleep_reset_resume to struct
dwc3_apple and tests it in dwc3_usb_role_switch_set() and
dwc3_usb_role_switch_get(). The dwc3-teardown host harness extracts
those functions and builds them against its own struct dwc3_apple in
dwc3/mocks.c, which has no such member, so the unit no longer compiles:

  host.c:3651:43: error: no member named 'sleep_reset_resume' in
  'struct dwc3_apple'

The usb-persist series was written on a tree without this harness, so it
could not update the mock. Add the field next to sleep_stopped, as
579bc680ee did for the other sleep fields. The fixture is zeroed by
initial(), so the existing cases run the not-in-sleep path unchanged.

Checked on the integration head: run.py --group lifecycle 35/35 with
this change; a mutant that inverts the reset-resume test in
dwc3_usb_role_switch_set() fails dwc3-teardown at cycles().

[j604 1.613: harness fixup for the usb-persist pick; tools/ only, no kernel object changes.]
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 tools/testing/selftests/drivers/gpu/apple-dcp/dwc3/mocks.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/tools/testing/selftests/drivers/gpu/apple-dcp/dwc3/mocks.c b/tools/testing/selftests/drivers/gpu/apple-dcp/dwc3/mocks.c
index e771f2dd0b..4baba008a3 100644
--- a/tools/testing/selftests/drivers/gpu/apple-dcp/dwc3/mocks.c
+++ b/tools/testing/selftests/drivers/gpu/apple-dcp/dwc3/mocks.c
@@ -87,6 +87,8 @@ struct dwc3_apple {
 	bool fixed_hub, core_active, core_exit_pending, reset_pending, shutting_down;
 	/* Stopped for a deep sleep, and the state to bring back. */
 	bool sleep_stopped;
+	/* T8132 host kept through a deep sleep: reset-resume instead of a restart. */
+	bool sleep_reset_resume;
 	enum dwc3_apple_state sleep_state;
 	bool rpm_held, host_only;
 	/* T8132 only: runtime PM before the first core probe; never set here. */
